          "brokerage": "Keller Williams Realty",
          "hero_eyebrow": "Real estate guidance for your next chapter",
          "hero_headline": "Make your next move with *clarity*, not pressure.",
          "hero_intro": "Whether you're downsizing, selling a family home, or planning for retirement, get straightforward answers from a local expert, before you ever have to make a decision.",
