              "link_label": "Plan your move",
              "link_url": "/learn?topic=next-chapter-planning"
            },
            {
              "title": "Buying your next home",
              "description": "Single-level living, low maintenance, the right location. Buy smart the second time around.",
              "link_label": "Buyer's roadmap",
              "link_url": "/#contact"
            }
          ],
          "guide_title": "The Rightsizing Playbook",
          "guide_card_text": "9 steps to sell your family home, simplify your life, and move with confidence. 32 pages, plain English.",
          "guide_heading": "Everything we wish every homeowner knew before they sold.",
          "guide_intro": "Written for homeowners 40+ who are weighing their options. No jargon, no sales pitch.",
          "guide_points": [
